==History==
2018
*The Royal Recruits were once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Royal Recruits Draft Challenge]], which started on 20/7/2018. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], gameplay was similar to a regular Draft Challenge, except that one of the players was able to choose who would use the Royal Recruits. If the player achieved at least 8 wins, they obtained the Royal Recruits early.
*On 27/7/2018, prior to the [[Cards|card]]'s general release, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (27/7/2018)|maintenance break]], increased the Royal Recruits' cost to 8 [[Elixir]] (from 6 Elixir).
*From 29/7/2018 through 1/8/2018, the [[Shop]] had a special offer where [[Arenas|Arena]] 7+ players could buy up to 6 special Fortune [[Chests]] for 300 [[Gems]] that guarantee at least 65% of the Chest's contents to be Royal Recruits. The Chest was able to generate up to 150% of its contents to be Royal Recruits.
*The Royal Recruits card was generally released on 7/8/2018.
*On 3/9/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/9/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Recruits damage by 12%, and slightly changed their spawn formation, allowing the Royal Recruits to be split to 2-4 or 4-2. It also added the Royal Recruits to [[Clan Wars]] [[Clan Wars/Clan Wars I|Collection Day]] Card pool.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed the Royal Recruits' sound effects. Previously, their sound effects were identical to those of the [[Guards]].
*On 3/12/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/12/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Royal Recruit's cost to 7 Elixir (from 8 Elixir), but also increased their attack time interval to 1.3 seconds (from 1.2 seconds).
2019
*On 28/1/2019, the [[Version History#January%202019%20Update%20(28/1/2019)|January 2019 Update]], added an extra [[Star Points|Star Level]].
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Royal Recruits' card info screen.
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], gave the Royal Recruits a new 0.1 second deploy stagger from each other.
*On 4/8/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Recruits damage by 8%.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], fixed an issue where Royal Recruits could be placed on the opposing player's side.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 4/9/2023, the [[Version History#Pass%20Royale%20and%20more%20(4/9/2023)|September 2023 Update]], added the Royal Recruits' Evolution.
2024
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Recruits’ hitpoints by 3%.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], made it so that Royal Recruits' spawn formation would be correctly mirrored depending on which side of the Arena they were placed.

